<title>USA: Team America Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Team America Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WORTHINGTON, Ohio 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>($000's except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues					  25,542	  21,461</p>
<p> Income Taxes					 154		77</p>
<p> Net Income					   232		91</p>
<p> Earnings per Share				 .07	     .04</p>
<p> Weighted Average Shares Outstanding  3,335,000     2,085,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it acquired Alternative Employee Management Inc during Q1 1997.</p>
<p>The company completed its initial public offering on December 10, 1996.</p>
</text>
